      "lines": [
        "给出的函数的图象."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "由三项式分出一个二项式的平方后，我们把这个方程写",
        "成另一形式，得到方程",
        "$y=\\frac{1}{2}(x-8)^2+3$.　（2）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看看方程（2）的（也就是和它同解的方程（1）的）图",
        "象是什么."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们求出方程（2）的图象上几个点的坐标. 容易看出，当",
        "$x=8$时，函数$y=\\frac{1}{2}(x-8)^2+3$取最小值$3$. 如果$x$的两个",
        "值和$8$相差同一个数，那么和它们对应的$y$值相等. 例如，如",
        "果$x=6$，那么$y=5$；如果$x=10$，那么也有$y=5$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在下表中给出了所讨论的函数图象上几个点的坐标："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "表",
      "box": [
        398,
        1706,
        1734,
        398
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "tbl-p0020-01"
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "描出上表中给出坐标的",
        "点并用光滑的曲线把它们连",
        "结后，就得到函数$y=\\frac{1}{2}(x↵-8)^2+3$的图象（图2）."
      ]
    },
